WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:10.677
[GETTING WET SO EARLY IN THE MORNING.]

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:17.434
[LET’S CHECK OUT P’PAM OVER HERE.]

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.521
[GETTING USED TO THE EQUIPMENT.]

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:27.652
[A WARMUP BEFORE TREATMENT.]

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:30.155
[ADDING SOME LIPSTICK.]

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:34.701
[NICE AND CLEAN.]

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:37.620
[EVEN TAKING A MASK OFF IS DIFFICULT.]
(Do it all the way.)

00:00:37.662 --> 00:00:38.204
(Try it.)

00:00:38.246 --> 00:00:39.414
(Yes.)
(Like that.)

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:48.506
[UNDER THE SUPERVISION
OF A REAL DENTAL STUDENT.]

00:00:50.925 --> 00:00:52.802
I just had my wisdom tooth removed by doctor Pam.

00:00:54.804 --> 00:00:57.140
(You had your mouth open for so long.)

00:00:57.182 --> 00:00:57.932
Yeah, my gum is all dry.
	[SO VERY LONG.]

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:01.936
Someone is eavesdropping.

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:08.026
(Dokrak, you came to get
dental treatment or some other treatment?)

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:09.569
Dental treatment, of course.

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:10.445
(Really?)

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:11.404
[NOT SUSPICIOUS AT ALL.]

00:01:11.446 --> 00:01:12.614
I didn’t come because of the dentist.

00:01:19.871 --> 00:01:21.247
[WHY STARING SO MUCH?]

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:25.126
Pam, do you like it?

00:01:28.546 --> 00:01:29.339
I like it.

00:01:29.339 --> 00:01:30.882
[YOU LIKE WHAT?]

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:35.512
[DRINK IT JUST TO PROVE IT.]

00:01:36.387 --> 00:01:37.430
[IT LOOKS SO GOOD.]

00:01:38.807 --> 00:01:40.850
[LOOKS LIKE SHE LIKES IT.]

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:44.938
[SHE’S FEEDING HER.]

00:01:47.315 --> 00:01:48.691
[LISTENING TO THE BRIEF.]

00:02:09.671 --> 00:02:11.005
[MAKING A FIST.]

00:02:17.178 --> 00:02:17.846
[WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?]

00:02:17.887 --> 00:02:19.472
(Why are you back?)

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:20.974
(Don’t you have friends?)

00:02:21.015 --> 00:02:22.058
(Why are you standing there?)

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:23.226
(Let the siblings talk.)

00:02:26.604 --> 00:02:27.856
[A BRIEF BEFORE A SHOOT.]

00:02:30.692 --> 00:02:33.027
Why are you eating candy now
right before seeing the dentist?

00:02:33.361 --> 00:02:34.863
The dentist will scold you.

00:02:35.947 --> 00:02:38.241
[SO STUBBORN.]
Good. That means we will
have something to talk about.

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:39.242
Bye!

00:02:40.743 --> 00:02:43.371
(You’ll be eating the whole time.)

00:02:45.248 --> 00:02:49.627
(While watching her eat, touch her forehead.

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:52.172
(Check the temperature.)

00:02:52.297 --> 00:02:54.299
(Then Dokrak becomes stiff.)

00:02:54.299 --> 00:02:55.717
(She doesn’t know how to act.)

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:02.140
(Cut. We got it.)

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:03.391
(Pass.)

00:03:03.933 --> 00:03:07.645
[ARE YOU THAT HAPPY?]

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:13.985
[PRACTICING EACH STEP.]

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:29.751
[SITTING AND RESTING THEIR LEGS.]

00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:56.694
[LET ME SEE TOO.]

00:03:59.405 --> 00:04:01.991
	[DON’T TEASE NONG.]

00:04:07.121 --> 00:04:08.373
Water makes you sleepy, huh?

00:04:08.414 --> 00:04:11.000
[ALMOST DOZE OFF WHILE STANDING.]

00:04:17.674 --> 00:04:21.261
[YOU SEEM TO LIKE IT.]

00:04:21.386 --> 00:04:22.929
(Taking a shower on set, right?)

00:04:22.929 --> 00:04:24.389
- (No need to shower at home.)
- 	Yes.

00:04:25.223 --> 00:04:26.808
Let’s take a morning shower, guys.

00:04:39.279 --> 00:04:40.363
(Okay, try pulling it.)

00:04:43.199 --> 00:04:44.367
(Closer.)

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:46.411
(A bit closer.)

00:04:46.411 --> 00:04:47.287
(Closer!)

00:04:47.328 --> 00:04:49.289
(Yeah. Like this.)

00:04:49.289 --> 00:04:50.581
[PEOPLE ARE VIBING SO MUCH.]

00:04:52.375 --> 00:04:53.626
(Like cheering a boxing match.)

00:04:53.668 --> 00:04:54.752
(Don’t be afraid to get close.)

00:04:56.296 --> 00:04:57.046
I can do it myself.

00:04:58.756 --> 00:05:01.426
[RAK IS MAKING A MOVE.]

00:05:03.428 --> 00:05:05.138
Pam, let me do it myself.

00:05:05.638 --> 00:05:07.598
It’s okay. I’ll do it.
[A DIFFERENT VERSION OF RAK &amp; PAM.]

00:05:08.308 --> 00:05:09.600
Let me do it myself.

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:12.437
Just do as I say. Your hair is long.

00:05:12.478 --> 00:05:14.314
No. Let me do it.

00:05:18.443 --> 00:05:19.652
[SHOWING THE KIDS HOW IT’S DONE.]
-	Let me do it myself, Pam.

00:05:21.321 --> 00:05:22.030
Just give it to me.

00:05:23.531 --> 00:05:25.074
(Yes, you have to pull her close like that.)

00:05:25.074 --> 00:05:26.492
Pam has to be the one that pulls.

00:05:26.492 --> 00:05:27.076
(Right.)

00:05:27.744 --> 00:05:28.953
I will do it.

00:05:28.953 --> 00:05:29.704
Don’t be stubborn.

00:05:29.746 --> 00:05:30.788
(There you go.)

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:31.873
Something like this.

00:05:31.914 --> 00:05:33.416
	[LET’S SEE THE REAL ACTRESSES NOW.]
- 	I can do it.

00:05:33.458 --> 00:05:34.584
Just do as I say.

00:05:35.585 --> 00:05:36.586
Let me dry it for you.

00:05:36.586 --> 00:05:37.754
I can do it myself.

00:05:38.546 --> 00:05:40.631
Your hair is long. How could you do it?

00:05:41.215 --> 00:05:42.175
I will do it.

00:05:42.216 --> 00:05:43.259
Don’t be stubborn.

00:05:43.593 --> 00:05:45.803
(Yes. That’s smoother than what we just did.)

00:05:51.351 --> 00:05:53.936
[LOOK OUT FOR NONG SO WELL.]

00:05:55.938 --> 00:05:58.649
(Will we see her hair in the close-up shot?)

00:05:58.691 --> 00:05:59.400
(Yes.)

00:06:00.443 --> 00:06:02.236
(Okay, kids. Here’s what we’ll do.)

00:06:02.278 --> 00:06:03.613
(While blowing Rak’s hair,

00:06:03.613 --> 00:06:09.285
Pam uses the left hand
to tug Rak’s hair behind her ear.)

00:06:10.119 --> 00:06:12.580
[IS IT DIFFICULT?]

00:06:15.249 --> 00:06:17.585
(Then you dry her hair like how we practiced.)

00:06:20.421 --> 00:06:22.423
(Let’s try it one more time.)

00:06:30.223 --> 00:06:32.850
[WHY MAKING THAT FACE?]

00:06:33.518 --> 00:06:34.852
[DOING HER OWN HAIR.]

00:06:40.108 --> 00:06:41.401
[BONNIE’S HITTING PHI.]

00:06:49.951 --> 00:06:50.993
Oops!

00:06:51.035 --> 00:06:52.370
[WE HAVE A PROBLEM!]

00:06:52.412 --> 00:06:54.247
[THE PROP HAS SMALL SCRATCHES.]

00:06:54.247 --> 00:06:55.164
It looks okay.

00:06:57.166 --> 00:07:01.879
SATURDAYS, 8:30 P.M. ON GMM25

